name walk-fungus1-07-to-30
title from the seeded card at the top of Fungus1_07 (arrival from Fungus1_06) through 07, 19, 10 and 30 to the arrival in Fungus1_31, with the same room fragments walk-new-game-to-hornet runs (no cheat)
max_ticks 40000
sync poll
# One segment of walk-new-game-to-hornet that starts from a known save. fungus1-07-top.mcd is a seeded record at the gate Fungus1_06 leads into 07 by (x 36, y 62).
card fungus1-07-top.mcd
wait 300
press cross
wait 40
press cross
wait until HK_GAME_MODE == 1 timeout 1200
include fungus1-07-chain.walk
include fungus1-19-chain.walk
include fungus1-10-chain.walk
include fungus1-30-chain.walk
check in-31 HK_DEATHS == 0 ; HK_CHEATS == 0 ; HK_HEALTH >= 1 ; HK_INPUT_MISSED_VBLANKS == 0
